- Departments are assignable to staff and encounters.

=== MDV-P7-004
title: SSO (SAML/OIDC via Entra federation), SCIM provisioning and facility/department role grants with expiry (H-03)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P7-E02
prd: P7-03
screens: H-03
priority: MUST
roles: Hospital IT
labels: sso, scim, roles
estimate: 4
weeks: 42-45
depends: MDV-P7-003
confidence: 72 | Standard Entra federation; SCIM specifics depend on the hospital IdP.
sources: design/Medvya Enterprise Pages (H-03)
desc:
Federate hospital IdP; SSO-enforced tenant; SCIM create/update/deactivate users; grants table user × role × facility scope × expiry; locum grants with end dates; licence count; quarterly access review.
ac:
- Deactivating a user in the hospital IdP removes Medvya access within the SCIM cycle.
- Role alone never grants another facility (tests).
- Expired grants end access automatically.

=== MDV-P7-005
title: Hospital integration console: connection tiles for HIS, LIS, ABDM/HIE, SSO, messaging (H-01)
type: Story
