=== MDV-P7-011
title: Dedicated hospital stamp: own compute, database, Key Vault (CMK/HSM), storage, private link; AKS move when required
type: Task
epic: MDV-P7-E04
prd: P7-06
covers: nfr:2
priority: MUST
roles: Developer
labels: infra, stamp, aks
estimate: 6
weeks: 52-58
depends: MDV-P7-001
confidence: 55 | Stage-4 architecture is described at a high level; specifics depend on the hospital contract.
sources: design/Medvya Azure Architecture (stages 3–4, dedicated hospital stamp); docs/03-architecture/azure-deployment.md
desc:
Bicep stamp template for a dedicated hospital deployment (Container Apps or AKS when isolation/node pools require it), customer-managed keys in Managed HSM, private link/VPN to the HIS, own upgrade ring and maintenance window, registration in the control plane.
ac:
- A new stamp can be created from the template without manual steps and registered for routing.
- Hospital data, keys, logs and backups are isolated from pooled tenants.
- Decision to move from App Service to AKS is recorded with the triggering evidence.

