=== MDV-P7-013
title: R7 hospital pilot, clinical sign-off and release
type: Gate
epic: MDV-P7-E03
prd: P7-04
covers: exit:1, exit:2, exit:3, pkg:1, pkg:2
priority: MUST
roles: Founder, Hospital IT, hospital clinicians
labels: release, gate
